WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Plants and animals change step by step after the ground is disturbed.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Pioneer plants arrive first. They grow fast and cover the bare soil.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
When those early plants die, their leaves and stems feed the soil.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Longer-lived grasses, herbs and shrubs gain a foothold and shelter more life.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Here on the Highveld, a healthy grassland can be the long-lived community.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Let the wild part of your farm grow into the kind of habitat that belongs there.
